        "original_id": "2acfa6f6-a056-58fe-9228-b25e83155337",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Franco, Aron Ralston, Amber Tamblyn\n- Films: 127 Hours, Milk, Pineapple Express, Rise of the Planet of the Apes, Spring Breakers, Oz the Great and Powerful, This Is the End, The Disaster Artist, Spider-Man trilogy, The Little Prince, Sausage Party, The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants, The Grudge 2, The Ring\n- Places: Blue John Canyon, southeastern Utah\n- TV Series: House\n- Roles: Martha M. Masters\n\nFacts:\n- In April 2003, Aron Ralston became trapped by a boulder in an isolated slot canyon in Blue John Canyon, southeastern Utah.\n- The film 127 Hours stars James Franco as Aron Ralston.\n- James Franco is known for live-action film roles in Milk, Pineapple Express, Rise of the Planet of the Apes, Spring Breakers, Oz the Great and Powerful, This Is the End, The Disaster Artist, and Sam Raimi's Spider-Man trilogy.\n- James Franco also voiced characters in the animated films The Little Prince and Sausage Party.\n- Amber Tamblyn's feature film work includes roles in The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants, The Grudge 2, The Ring, and 127 Hours.\n- Amber Tamblyn had an extended arc as Martha M. Masters on the main cast of the medical drama series House.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
